{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09170","headline":"送陆侍御还越 · 韦应物","name":"送陆侍御还越","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"居藩久不乐，遇子聊一欣。\n英声颇籍甚，交辟乃时珍。\n绣衣过旧里，骢马辉四邻。\n敬恭尊郡守，牋简具州民。\n谬忝诚所愧，思怀方见申。\n置榻宿清夜，加笾醼良辰。\n遵涂还盛府，行舫遶长津。\n自有贤方伯，得此文翰宾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}